\" width=\"800\" height=\"48\">"},{"r":9323,"d":1973,"s":"note","t":"CGast","c":0,"p":null,"l":"","x":"```python\n# code generator for producing the AST only, with facilities for printing\n\nfrom SC import TIMES, DIV, MOD, AND, PLUS, MINUS, OR, EQ, NE, LT, GT, LE, GE\nfrom ST import indent, Bool\n\nclass Una"},{"r":9324,"d":1973,"s":"note","t":"CGast","c":1,"p":null,"l":"","x":"class Call:\n  def __init__(self, res, ident, param):\n    self.res, self.ident, self.param = res, ident, param\n\n  def __str__(self):\n    return (\n      'call '\n      + (str(self.res) if self.res else '"},{"r":9325,"d":1973,"s":"note","t":"CGast","c":2,"p":null,"l":"","x":"def __str__(self):\n    return str(self.arr) + '[]\\n ' + indent(self.ind)\n\nclass FieldSelection:\n  def __init__(self, rec, fld):\n    self.tp, self.rec, self.fld = fld.tp, rec, fld\n\n  #        self.tp, "},{"r":9326,"d":1973,"s":"note","t":"CGast","c":3,"p":null,"l":"","x":"def genVar(x):\n  # assuming x is ST.Var, ST.Ref, ST.Const\n  return x\n\ndef genConst(x):\n  return x\n\ndef genUnaryOp(op, x):\n  return UnaryOp(op, x)\n\ndef genBinaryOp(op, x, y):\n  return BinaryOp(op, x.tp"},{"r":9327,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":0,"p":null,"l":"","x":"### P0 Code Generator for MIPS\n#### Emil Sekerinski, March 2017; updated March 2020\n\nThe generated code is kept in memory and all code generation procedures continuously append to that code: procedure"},{"r":9328,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":1,"p":null,"l":"","x":"Following variables determine the state of the code generator:\n\n- `curlev` is the current level of nesting of P0 procedures\n- `regs` is the set of available MIPS registers for expression evaluation\n- "},{"r":9329,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":2,"p":null,"l":"","x":"```python\ndef putLab(lab, instr=''):\n  \"\"\"Emit label lab with optional instruction; lab may be a single\n  label or a non-empty list of labels\"\"\"\n  if type(lab) == list:\n    for l in lab[:-1]:\n      as"},{"r":9330,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":3,"p":null,"l":"","x":"```python\ndef genBool(b):\n  # b is Bool\n  b.size = 4\n  return b\n\ndef genInt(i):\n  # i is Int\n  i.size = 4\n  return i\n\ndef genRec(r):\n  # r is Record\n  s = 0\n  for f in r.fields:\n    f.offset, s = s, s"},{"r":9331,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":4,"p":null,"l":"","x":"```python\ndef genProgEntry(ident):\n  putInstr('.globl main')\n  putLab('main')\n```\n\nProcedure `genProgExit(x)` takes parameter `x` with the result of previous `gen-` calls, generates code for exiting t"},{"r":9332,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":5,"p":null,"l":"","x":"```python\nclass Reg:\n  def __init__(self, tp, reg):\n    # tp is Bool or Int\n    self.tp, self.reg = tp, reg\n\nclass Cond:\n  # labA, labB are lists of branch targets for when the result is true or false"},{"r":9333,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":6,"p":null,"l":"","x":"```python\ndef loadItem(x):\n  if type(x) == Const and x.val == 0:\n    r = R0  # use R0 for \"0\"\n  elif x in reguse:\n    r = reguse[x]\n  else:\n    r = obtainReg()\n    loadItemReg(x, r)\n    reguse[x] = r\n"},{"r":9334,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":7,"p":null,"l":"","x":"def loadBool(x):\n  if type(x) == Const and x.val == 0:\n    r = R0  # use R0 for \"false\"\n  else:\n    r = obtainReg()\n    loadItemReg(x, r)\n  return Cond(NE, r, R0)\n```\n\nProcedure `put(cd, x, y)` genera"},{"r":9335,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":8,"p":null,"l":"","x":"# def put(cd, x, y):\n#     if type(x) != Reg: x = loadItem(x) # check if already in some register\n#     if x.reg in (R0, A0, A1, A2, A3): # find new destination register\n#         r = x.reg; x.reg = o"},{"r":9336,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":9,"p":null,"l":"","x":"\"\"\"\ndef genVar(x): # version supporting parameters in registers\n    if 0 < x.lev < curlev: mark('MIPS: level!')\n    if type(x) == Ref:\n        y = Var(x.tp); y.lev = x.lev\n        if x.reg in (A0, A1,"},{"r":9337,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":10,"p":null,"l":"","x":"```python\ndef negate(cd):\n  return {EQ: NE, NE: EQ, LT: GE, LE: GT, GT: LE, GE: LT}[cd]\n\ndef condOp(cd):\n  return {EQ: 'beq', NE: 'bne', LT: 'blt', LE: 'ble', GT: 'bgt', GE: 'bge'}[cd]\n\ndef genUnaryOp"},{"r":9338,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":11,"p":null,"l":"","x":"Procedure `genBinaryOp(op, x, y)` generates code for `x op y` if `op` is `PLUS`, `MINUS`, `TIMES`, `DIV`, `MOD`. If `op` is `AND`, `OR`, operand `y` is made a `Cond` item it if is not so already and t"},{"r":9339,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":12,"p":null,"l":"","x":"Procedure `genSelect(x, f)` \"generates code\" for `x.f`, provided `f` is in `x.fields`. Only `x.adr` is updated, no code is generated. An updated item is returned.\n\n```python\ndef genSelect(x, f):\n  x.t"},{"r":9340,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":13,"p":null,"l":"","x":"Procedure `genAssign(x, y)` generates code for `x := y`, provided `x` is `Var`. Item `x` is loaded into a register if it is not already there; if `y` is `Cond`, then either `0` or `1` is loaded into a"},{"r":9341,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":14,"p":null,"l":"","x":"The procedure calling convention is as follows:\n- last parameter at `0($fp)`, 2nd last at `4($fp)`, ...\n- previous frame pointer at `-4($fp)`\n- return address at `-8($fp)`\n- 1st local at `-12($fp)`, ."},{"r":9342,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":15,"p":null,"l":"","x":"Procedure `genProcStart(ident, fp)` sets the register for the first four parameters and determines the FP-relative address of the remaining parameters in the list `fp` of procedure parameters. Each pa"},{"r":9343,"d":1974,"s":"note","t":"P0 Code Generator for MIPS","c":16,"p":null,"l":"","x":"Procedures `genProcEntry(ident, parsize, localsize)` and `genProcExit(x, parsize, localsize)` generate the procedure prologue and epilogue.\n\n```python\ndef genProcEntry(ident, parsize, localsize):\n  pu"}]